// ════════════════════════════════  SIGNAL  ══════════════════════════════
// The trigger, inside a valid setup. Instantaneous, where the setup is a
// standing condition.
//
// It is the change of character the structure model publishes, and it is
// the same for every setup — which is why it lives here and not inside
// one. How it meets the region the setup chose, in particular whether the
// direction has to agree with that region's side, is not settled yet.
//
// The structure section already marks it on the chart. Drawing it again
// here would only double the triangles.

signalFired = structChoch
signalDir   = structChDir
